Third-party reference data
--------------------------

The postal-code anchor mappings under api/seed/postal_codes_us.csv
and the MSA region rows under api/seed/regions_us_msas.toml are
derived from US Census Bureau geographic reference files:

  - CBSA Delineation Files (List 1, July 2023):
    https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/metro-micro/about/delineation-files.html
  - 2020 ZCTA Relationship Files (ZCTA-to-place, ZCTA-to-county):
    https://www.census.gov/geographies/reference-files/time-series/geo/relationship-files.html

US Census Bureau publications are works of the federal government and
are in the public domain (17 U.S.C. § 105). No attribution is legally
required, but downstream users are encouraged to credit the Census
Bureau when republishing this derived data, e.g.:

  Postal-to-region anchors and MSA membership derived from US Census
  Bureau geographic reference files (public domain).

The original Census files themselves are not redistributed by this
repository — only the reshaped + curated derivative outputs under
api/seed/ are committed. See etl/SOURCES.md for the upstream URLs and
vintage manifest.
